amenities.csv.gz — OpenStreetMap-derived amenity extract for the Comune di Milano

This file is a Produced Work / Derived Database built from OpenStreetMap data
(subway and tram stops, large parks, supermarkets, schools and pharmacies, clipped to
Milano plus a 1 km margin), regenerated by scripts/refresh_amenities.py from a Geofabrik
extract. The OSM snapshot date is recorded as "osm_snapshot" in manifest.json.

